OL,3,APC inappropriately accessed police
OL,4,Arecords 2,000 times
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn officer who inappropriately accessed
OL,7,Fpolice records more than 2,000 times
OL,8,Fhas been sacked for gross misconduct.
OL,10,FA West Midlands Police misconduct
OL,11,Fhearing acknowledged PC Shannon Parsons
OL,12,Ffelt "isolated and disconnected" due to
OL,13,Fworking part-time and returning from
OL,14,Fmaternity leave, but had breached
OL,15,Fstandards of professional behaviour.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
