OL,3,APC inappropriately accessed police
OL,4,Arecords 2,000 times
OL,5,
OL,6,FParsons had claimed there was a
OL,7,Fpolicing purpose to her searches, the
OL,8,Fpanel said, and was seeking to "keep
OL,9,Fherself up to date, informed and was
OL,10,Foften in a position to support and
OL,11,Fassist other colleagues in operational
OL,12,Fmatters".
OL,14,FHowever, chair of the panel Debra Tedds
OL,15,Fconcluded the searches were carried out
OL,16,Ffor the officer's "own personal
OL,17,Fbenefit".
